# Recorded third-party response bodies are replayed byte-for-byte by msw. With
# core.autocrlf=true (this Windows dev machine) git would check the Census batch
# `text/plain` fixtures out with CRLF, and they would no longer be the verbatim body the
# service sent. `-text` turns end-of-line conversion off for them only.
# tests/unit/msw/server.ts refuses a batch fixture carrying a CR at load.
tests/unit/msw/fixtures/*.txt -text
